        <mxCell id="sample_sort-129" value="All cpus have now the [4,10,30] samples. In practice this means that:&lt;br&gt;- cpu 0 will receive all data below 4&lt;br&gt;- cpu 1 will receive all data from 4 up to 10 (excluded)&lt;br&gt;- cpu 2 will receive all data from 10 up to 30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="sample_sort-figure">
