        <mxCell id="sample_sort-130" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 4&lt;/b&gt;: Each CPU sends the portion of its segments to the corresponding CPU - as given&lt;br&gt;by the samples - and sorts the data it receives. As the samples split the range of values&lt;br&gt;in the order of the CPUs' ranks, the final data is sorted across all CPUs." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="sample_sort-figure">
